cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the harmonised benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "AssayOT: reports are not cleavage - two estimands in cross-study CRISPR-Cas9 off-target prediction"
abstract: >-
  Code, harmonised provenance-aware benchmark and manuscript for separating cellular
  cleavage activity from laboratory detection in CRISPR-Cas9 off-target data, under
  incomplete labels and cross-study shift.
type: software
